question:
Match the sign combinations of ΔH and ΔS with the temperature condition and spontaneity: 
(A) ΔH(+), ΔS(-), any T → Non-spontaneous; 
(B) ΔH(+), ΔS(+), low T → Spontaneous; 
(C) ΔH(-), ΔS(-), low T → Non-spontaneous; 
(D) ΔH(-), ΔS(+), any T → Spontaneous. 
Which statement(s) is/are correct?
